# DNSSEC private keys -- never commit these. The .signed zones and
# the resolver's trust-anchor.conf (which only contains a PUBLIC
# DNSKEY, extracted from the root KSK) are committed as required
# deliverables; the actual key files (.key AND .private -- both
# regenerated fresh by scripts/sign-zones.sh on every run anyway) are
# excluded.
**/*.private
**/*.key

# Regenerable signing byproducts -- scripts/sign-zones.sh recreates
# these from the plain .zone source every time it runs, so keeping
# them in git would just be noise that goes stale.
**/*.ds
**/dsset-*
**/*.zone.signing
